{"title":"1978 AHSME Problems/Problem 11","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_11\">Problem 11</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1978_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 11\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/5/b55ca7a0aa88ab7d58f4fc035317fdac39b17861.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> is positive and the line whose equation is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/e/a7e1d487ca4e890d08fc8af04b952f1bc1ed3821.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x + y = r$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"77\" height=\"16\" /> is tangent to the circle whose equation is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/a/3/da324599335bf7c87ab5a8caf55d30c3dbc5ca70.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2 + y ^2 = r$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"89\" height=\"18\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/5/b55ca7a0aa88ab7d58f4fc035317fdac39b17861.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> equals\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/1/8/11879ded9339eeb7601268e289878b1337c5c0ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) }\\frac{1}{2}\\qquad \\textbf{(B) }1\\qquad \\textbf{(C) }2\\qquad \\textbf{(D) }\\sqrt{2}\\qquad  \\textbf{(E) }2\\sqrt{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"397\" height=\"37\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1978_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The circle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/4/3/043180dbf2c5889783b448ebb8acee53e2e0a102.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2 + y^2 = r$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"89\" height=\"18\" /> has center <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/6/f9603ca3089464e548fc6f1366bc474e7efef8d9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(0,0)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"42\" height=\"20\" /> and radius <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/a/3/6a3e9006ecc9debb184b411a0fb4e94a291b9b62.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{r}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"24\" height=\"18\" />. Therefore, if the line <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/e/a7e1d487ca4e890d08fc8af04b952f1bc1ed3821.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x + y = r$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"77\" height=\"16\" /> is tangent to the circle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/4/3/043180dbf2c5889783b448ebb8acee53e2e0a102.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2 + y^2 = r$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"89\" height=\"18\" />, then the distance between <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/6/f9603ca3089464e548fc6f1366bc474e7efef8d9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(0,0)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"42\" height=\"20\" /> and the line <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/e/a7e1d487ca4e890d08fc8af04b952f1bc1ed3821.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x + y = r$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"77\" height=\"16\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/a/3/6a3e9006ecc9debb184b411a0fb4e94a291b9b62.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{r}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"24\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p><p>The distance between <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/6/f9603ca3089464e548fc6f1366bc474e7efef8d9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(0,0)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"42\" height=\"20\" /> and the line <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/e/a7e1d487ca4e890d08fc8af04b952f1bc1ed3821.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x + y = r$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"77\" height=\"16\" /> is\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/9/4/b945d4f5775e3c5af1d4d6c49ef179f0b3d1275d.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{|0 + 0 - r|}{\\sqrt{1^2 + 1^2}} = \\frac{r}{\\sqrt{2}}.\\]\" width=\"139\" height=\"43\" />\nHence,\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/b/6/6b635c1002400d74a0b8795883a69210898557b4.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{r}{\\sqrt{2}} = \\sqrt{r}.\\]\" width=\"78\" height=\"37\" />\nThen <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/7/2/772e15c89ce4e611a38fec1367f4b0e2524bb81c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r = \\sqrt{r} \\cdot \\sqrt{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"94\" height=\"20\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/7/ba7cd6e38f8f60ee66498d01b9f531a6b5b6c078.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{r} = \\sqrt{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"73\" height=\"20\" />, which means <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/b/b/7bb1259828b0388518c9f0eb88df494e8f23a543.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r = \\boxed{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"53\" height=\"23\" /> or (C), <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1978_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1978_AHSME\" title=\"1978 AHSME\">1978 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1978_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1978 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1978_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1978 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1978\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1978_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1978 AHSME Problems/Problem 10\">Problem 10</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1978_AHSME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1978 AHSME Problems/Problem 12\">Problem 12</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1978_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1978 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1978_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1978 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1978_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1978 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1978_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1978 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1978_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1978 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1978_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1978 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1978_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1978 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1978_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1978 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1978_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1978 AHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1978_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"197